OB_Boot_Configuration_active_BOOT_LOCK|Activate BOOT LOCK|Boot Configuration||||
BootLock|BOOT_LOCK|Boot Configuration||||<font color="red">Bit 0</font> <b> BOOT_LOCK:</b> Boot lock. The boot is always forced to base address value programmed in SECBOOTADD0 Unchecked:Boot based on the pad/option bit configuration. Checked: Boot forced from base address memory.
OB_Secure_Area1_active|Activate Secure Area 1|Secure Area||||
OB_SECWM1_PSTR_Address|WMSEC Start page|Secure Area||0|=numberOfPages-1|This field contains the first page of the secure area in bank 1.
OB_SECWM1_PEND_Address|WMSEC End page|Secure Area||0|=numberOfPages-1|This field contains the last page of the secure area in bank 1.
OB_HDP1_PEND_Address|HDP End page|Secure Area||0|=numberOfPages-1|This field contains the last page of the HDP area in bank 1
OB_HDP1EN|HDP1EN|Secure Area||||<font color="red">Bit 31</font> <b> HDP1EN</b> Hide protection first area enable Unchecked: No HDP area 1 Checked: HDP first area is enable
OB_Secure_Area2_active|Activate Secure Area 2|Secure Area||||
OB_SECWM2_PSTR_Address|WMSEC Start page|Secure Area||0|=numberOfPages-1|This field contains the first page of the secure area in bank 2.
OB_SECWM2_PEND_Address|WMSEC End page|Secure Area||0|=numberOfPages-1|This field contains the first page of the secure area in bank 2.
OB_HDP2_PEND_Address|HDP End page|Secure Area||0|=numberOfPages-1|This field contains the last page of the HDP area in bank 2
OB_HDP2EN|HDP2EN|Secure Area||||<font color="red">Bit 31</font> <b> HDP2EN:</b> Hide protection first area enable Unchecked: No HDP area 2 Checked: HDP first area is enable
OB_Write_Protection1A_active|Activate WRP 1A|Write Protection||||
OB_WRP1A_PSTR_Value|Start page|Write Protection||0|=numberOfPages-1|Bank 1 WPR first area A start page
OB_WRP1A_PEND_Value|End page|Write Protection||0|=numberOfPages-1|Bank 1 WPR first area A end page
OB_UNLOCK_1A|UNLOCK|Write Protection||||<font color="red">Bit 0</font> <b> UNLOCK_1A:</b> UNLOCK_1A. Bank 1 WPR first area A unlock Unchecked: WRP1A start and end pages locked Checked: WRP1A start and end pages unlocked
OB_Write_Protection1B_active|Activate WRP 1B|Write Protection||||
OB_WRP1B_PSTR_Value|Start page|Write Protection||0|=numberOfPages-1|Bank 1 WPR first area B start page
